#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:3
msgid "Arm"
msgstr "Arm"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``Arm`` class represents the robot arm and gripper. It groups "
"together the motors used to move the arm and open or close the gripper."
msgstr ""
"La classe ``Arm`` représente le bras et la pince du robot. Elle regroupe "
"les moteurs utilisés pour déplacer le bras et ouvrir ou fermer la pince."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:14
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:16
msgid "Retrieve the arm motor."
msgstr "Récupérer le moteur du bras."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:17
msgid "Retrieve the two gripper motors."
msgstr "Récupérer les deux moteurs de la pince."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:18
msgid "Retrieve the arm position sensor."
msgstr "Récupérer le capteur de position du bras."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:19
msgid "Raise the arm."
msgstr "Lever le bras."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:20
msgid "Lower the arm."
msgstr "Baisser le bras."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:21
msgid "Open the gripper."
msgstr "Ouvrir la pince."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:22
msgid "Close the gripper."
msgstr "Fermer la pince."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:26
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:28
msgid ""
"The motors and the sensor are private: ``armMotor``, "
"``gripperLeftMotor``, ``gripperRightMotor`` and ``armSensor``. The arm "
"and gripper positions are stored in private constants."
msgstr ""
"Les moteurs et le capteur sont privés : ``armMotor``, "
"``gripperLeftMotor``, ``gripperRightMotor`` et ``armSensor``. Les "
"positions du bras et de la pince sont stockées dans des constantes "
"privées."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:34
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:36
msgid ""
"``Arm`` is owned by ``TERBot``. It depends on ``Motor``, "
"``PositionSensor`` and ``Supervisor``."
msgstr ""
"``Arm`` est possédée par ``TERBot``. Elle dépend de ``Motor``, "
"``PositionSensor`` et ``Supervisor``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:41
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:44
msgid "``Arm(Supervisor robot, int timeStep)``"
msgstr "``Arm(Supervisor robot, int timeStep)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:46
msgid ""
"Constructor. It retrieves ``arm_motor``, ``gripper_left_motor``, "
"``gripper_right_motor`` and ``arm_sensor``. If the position sensor "
"exists, it is enabled. The constructor then moves the arm to the raised "
"position and opens the gripper."
msgstr ""
"Constructeur. Il récupère ``arm_motor``, ``gripper_left_motor``, "
"``gripper_right_motor`` et ``arm_sensor``. Si le capteur de position "
"existe, il est activé. Le constructeur place ensuite le bras en position "
"levée et ouvre la pince."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:53
msgid "``lift()``"
msgstr "``lift()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:55
msgid "Raises the arm by setting the arm motor to the ``ARM_UP`` position."
msgstr ""
"Lève le bras en plaçant le moteur du bras à la position ``ARM_UP``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:58
msgid "``lower()``"
msgstr "``lower()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:60
msgid "Lowers the arm by setting the arm motor to the ``ARM_DOWN`` position."
msgstr ""
"Baisse le bras en plaçant le moteur du bras à la position ``ARM_DOWN``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:63
msgid "``openGripper()``"
msgstr "``openGripper()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:65
msgid ""
"Opens the gripper by applying the open position to the left and right "
"gripper motors."
msgstr ""
"Ouvre la pince en appliquant une position d'ouverture au moteur gauche et "
"au moteur droit."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:69
msgid "``closeGripper()``"
msgstr "``closeGripper()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/arm.rst:71
msgid ""
"Closes the gripper by applying the closed position to the left and right "
"gripper motors."
msgstr ""
"Ferme la pince en appliquant une position de fermeture au moteur gauche "
"et au moteur droit."